<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Nouveau message - Vice & Délice</title>
</head>

<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f1f3; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #2b2430;">

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color: #f4f1f3; padding: 40px 20px;">
